keywords:
  - volleyball
  - sports analytics
  - computer vision
  - multi-object tracking
  - YOLO
  - time-series classification
  - tactical analysis
abstract: >-
  An end-to-end pipeline that turns single-camera broadcast volleyball video
  into a second-by-second reading of a team's collective tactic (Coordinated
  Attack, Coordinated Defense, Delayed Support, Spacing Breakdown). It combines
  YOLO11 detection, BoT-SORT tracking, automatic court calibration, colour-based
  team separation and an 18-channel permutation-invariant formation descriptor,
  classified by gradient-boosted trees and deep sequence models evaluated
  leave-one-video-out.
